COMPILATION OF: E524B

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E524B

   1 a 0000 E524B: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-19 probe B (PLAN residue):    */
   3 a 0006    /* replica of the LOAN2 retry context      */
   4 a 0006    /* between the two caret literals: the DEC */
   5 a 0006    /* division by the integer literal 1200    */
   6 a 0006    /* and the 1.00 store to fixed dec(15,14). */
   7 c 0006    dcl ir fixed decimal(4,2);
   8 c 0006    dcl fi fixed decimal(7,5);
   9 c 0006    dcl ci fixed decimal(15,14);
  10 c 0006    dcl output file;
  11 c 0006    put list('^i^i%Inflation     ');
  12 c 001D    get list(ir);
  13 c 003C    fi = 1 + ir/1200;
  14 c 006C    ci = 1.00;
  15 c 007C    put skip(2) list('^i^iStarting Month ');
  16 c 0098    put list('control literal');
  17 a 00AF end E524B;

CODE SIZE = 00B2
DATA AREA = 0053
FREE SYMS = 37B2
END  COMPILATION
